  "translation": "Akĩithĩra kũo, akamona ⟨את⟩ Yehonadabi mũrũ wa Rekabi amũkĩrĩra, akamũraũrĩria, na akĩmũũria: Nĩgũkorwo ⟨את⟩ ngoro yaku ĩitheru, ta ngoro yakwa ĩrĩ na yaku? Nake Yehonadabi akiuga: Nĩguo, nĩguo. Nĩrĩa, heana ⟨את⟩ mkono waku. Nĩake akĩheana moko wake, nake akamũinyithia kũrĩ we ĩngĩ irigithathi-inĩ.",
